WEBVTT

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.440
Okay, we're here.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.620
I wonder if Mikan-chan is here?

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.110
It'll be okay.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.330
All right, let's go.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:15.130
Yeah.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.570
Wah!?

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:35.320
Lala!?

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.720
Why are you walking around like that again?

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.520
Well, I forgot to prepare clothes to change into!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.730
Just hurry up and put some clothes-

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.970
Ah! I'm s-sorry, I slipped! {Rito's babbling apology after he gets up}

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.410
Good grief.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.330
I see you're up to the usual.

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.600
Yesterday Sachi and Mami asked...

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:08.650
Can we come over to play tomorrow?

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:10.340
But... {tte kikareta kedo}

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:17.470
I can't have my classmates over in a house where spectacles like this happen on a daily basis.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.750
A-Anyway, go back to your room and put on some clothes!

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.540
Okay!

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.430
Hm? {as the doorbell rings}

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:26.390
Was there a delivery today?{I wonder if it's a delivery company?}

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:32.360
Now that I think about it, {I think }mum said she was going to send some new clothes she designed from Paris.

