00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:41.110
<b>~Imagination and Reality~」</b>

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:43.240
We just happened to be in the area, so we thought we'd stop by.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:46.290
S-Sorry to come by unexpectedly, Mikan-chan.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.680
I let my guard down! {yudan shita}

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.790
Is it okay if we come in for a little bit? {You're already inside!}

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:51.570
Eh!?

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.630
I'm kind of in the middle of something right now!

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:55.690
Oh?

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.130
Are these your friends, Mikan?

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:58.860
Ah!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.260
Onii-san, pleased to meet you!

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:01.950
My name is Kogure Sachie!

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:03.690
I'm Nogiwa Mami.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.450
Nice to meet you.

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:07.640
I knew it, they came to see Rito.

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.360
We should let them come in for a bit since they're already here.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:14.360
Yeah, I guess so.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:20.350
It should be okay if it's just for a little while... I think.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.580
Here you go.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.300
Oh, thank you!

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:28.940
Here.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.170
Ah, thank you.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:34.080
I'll be going back to my room, so take it easy.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.260
Ah. Please wait, Onii-san!

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:41.660
We were thinking it would be nice to talk to you too, right Mami?

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:42.730
Yeah.

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:43.640
But...

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.890
Wait a sec, Sachi!

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.860
Rito has nothing to do with your visit, does he?

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:48.770
Oh come on, it's fine isn't it?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.690
I'm saying it for your sakes!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:55.400
If one of Rito's epic falls happens to Sachi and Mami, what will I do?

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.530
Hey, Onii-san, I said hey!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.880
No!

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.420
M-Mikan...

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:15.820
Ah... Uh... Um...

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.930
So that means "Onii-chan belongs only to me!", right!?

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:22.300
You don't have to worry, we won't take him away!

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:24.300
It's not that!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.930
It was because Rito was going to fall!

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:32.060
Mikan-chan, the way you immediately reacted to save your beloved Onii-chan was so wonderful!

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:37.260
At school, all Mikan talks about is you.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:40.190
H-Hey! What are you saying, Sachi!?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.320
Ah!

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.660
I thought I heard something in here{it was pretty lively}!

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.450
Looks like we have guests!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.120
You're Mikan-san's friends, right?

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.460
Oh no!

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:53.420
More of the ones who make dangerous things happen are here!

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.700
Um, who are these people...?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.250
Ah, they're living with us here.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.590
Didn't I tell you about them?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.090
There's a flower on her head!?

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:07.610
Eh?

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:09.850
So they're all aliens?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.670
What's more, they're princesses!?

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.090
Awesome!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:19.030
I'm the second princess, and she's the third.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.860
There's not much difference between the second and third.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.290
Nana, you get excited so easily.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.170
Don't encourage her, okay?

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.820
What did you say, Momo!?

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.740
Geez, would you two stop fighting?

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:33.890
I'm so relieved.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:39.970
I was worried that Momo-san alone would get
Sachi and Mami involved in something strange,

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.960
but thanks to Lala-san and the others,

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.300
the mood is nice and heart-warming.

