00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.110
Please take good care of Mikan from now on, too.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.410
Yes!

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:01.900
Thank you very much for today, Onii-san!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.250
See you later, Mikan!

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:05.870
See you tomorrow!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.660
Yeah, see you!

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:10.350
All right!

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.160
They left {went back home }without anything happening!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.500
Isn't that nice.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:18.260
You shouldn't be so reserved, you could have them over more often, you know.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:23.130
He doesn't know anything about how I felt.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.220
Rito.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.300
Hm?

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.470
Let me tell you something!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:32.360
When I talk about you at school, I'm complaining to Sachi and Mami!

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.430
Where's this coming from, suddenly?

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:42.740
There are so many pretty people at Mikan-chan's house.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.050
Onii-chan was wonderful, as well.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:49.200
Well, he seemed a little more childish than I thought, but he's okay.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.120
Ah! Oh no!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:54.790
I left behind the manga I just bought!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.750
I'm going to go get it!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:56.160
Ah.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.670
Mikan, I'm sorry, I forgot someth-

00:06:10.630 --> 00:06:11.800
Ah.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.470
I can just get it later, sorry to interrupt.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.950
How can you just accept that so easily!?

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:25.520
They really are very close siblings, aren't they?

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.360
Yeah.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:33.160
Kogure Sachie and Nogiwa Mami.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.530
I'll write a memo just in case.

