00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.390
Ah!

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.660
What happened!?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.830
What is it, Rito?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:57.930
Lala...

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:01.440
I accidentally stepped on my cell-phone...

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.610
Oh, my!

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:07.220
Looks like I have no choice but to buy a new one.

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:09.200
I'll fix it for you!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.070
Hm?

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:12.900
It's for my precious Rito, after all.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:13.780
Leave it to me!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:21.100
Onee-sama sure is reliable.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.710
She's really good with mechanical things.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:27.140
Did you say you were going to call Kotegawa-san?

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.090
Yeah.

