00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:14.800
{=60}Chairman Activity Report

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.060
Hm?

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.400
This ringtone...

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.270
Yuuki-kun!?

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.300
Hello?

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.440
What business do you have at this time?

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:36.160
Good grief, people like you...

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.720
Ah, Kotegawa.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.590
Sorry for the unexpected phone call.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:45.000
I'm actually calling about Celine.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.530
Do you have a minute?

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:49.670
W-What is this...?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.470
Hello?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.680
Can you hear me, Kotegawa?

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.630
I can hear you!

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:06.940
That's good.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:11.260
Thanks for that picture book, "The Cat's Tail".

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.950
Celine has really taken a liking to it!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:21.790
J-Just hearing Yuuki-kun's voice is making me feel good,

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.960
and it feels like I'm losing my strength.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.450
Hello?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.710
Kotegawa?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.390
I said I can hear you!

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:35.730
I'm glad that she likes it.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.630
What's going on?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:40.570
I must be tired.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.750
I read it too.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.640
The pictures are really cute, aren't they?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:52.440
The story has depth too, so even adults can enjoy reading it.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:55.700
I have to keep my composure...

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.780
Yeah, it does, doesn't it?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.940
I really love... this.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.740
I can't...

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:30.100
It's like Yuuki-kun's voice is taking form and touching me.

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:46.620
I can't... I have to end the call quickly.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.580
U-Um...

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.280
Hm?

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.800
Oh, right, right.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.690
Celine really likes this scene in particular.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:03.640
The white cat who got lost in the fairy's house...

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.110
...hid inside a honeypot.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:13.110
The sticky, syrupy honey oozed all around her.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:22.040
And her mind went blank from the sweet scent it gave off.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.630
N-No...

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:52.140
The white cat, with no hesitation, licked the honey off of herself.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:22.600
It was a sweetness, as if she had ascended to heaven.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:41.090
The white cat was so tsun-tsun but she
becomes so cute at this part, doesn't she?

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:48.530
And it ends happily with the white cat getting together with the kind black cat prince!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.190
It really is a good book.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.060
Thanks so much!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.620
Kotegawa?

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.710
Huh?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.250
Can you hear me?

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.550
Hey, Kotegawa?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.030
Hey...?

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.600
It cut off.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.460
It's still broken, big sis.

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:13.550
Eh!?

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:16.020
But it should be fixed...

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:20.420
Why don't you try calling a different phone and testing if you can talk okay?

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:21.800
Good idea.

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.730
Mikan, is your cell-phone in your room?

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:27.530
In that case, why don't you try calling my D-Dial?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:29.530
All right.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.050
Hello, Rito-san!

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:39.000
Momo, can you hear my voice?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:41.870
Ah!?

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:42.930
Momo!?

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:47.320
What's wrong, Momo!?

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.350
What's going on!?

00:13:54.900 --> 00:14:00.110
It seems the cause is the mic in the
handset has been tuned to be too sensitive.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:07.520
When you talk to someone on this phone it turns into a charmed voice that makes them feel good.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:08.360
Eh!?

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.530
Then Kotegawa, as well!?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.370
Most likely she became stimulated to the point where she could no longer hold a conversation.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.870
Looks like I was too concerned with sound quality!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.380
Kotegawa is going to be angry with me again!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:26.380
I'm so glad he didn't call me. {I'm not :(}

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:28.380
Huh?

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.500
Mum, where's Yui?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.890
She took a bath and went to sleep a while ago.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.640
Oh?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.510
It's unusual for her to go to sleep this early.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.060
It really is.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.360
So shameless...

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:06.380
It has long been said that various miracles can occur on the night of the full moon.

