00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:05.280
<b>「Moonlight</b>

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:05.280
<b>~Angel Beneath the Moon~」</b>

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:05.280
<b>~Angel Beneath the Moon~」</b>

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:11.890
Scientifically speaking as well, the moon's gravitational force has a great effect upon the biorhythm of the life on earth.

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:17.230
Sorry for making you wait so long to get watered.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:19.390
You're growing up so well.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:24.010
But the moon sure is pretty tonig-

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:24.900
Huh?

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:59.350
The moon... really is pretty, isn't it?

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:07.160
W-Why is there a naked girl on the roof!?

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:10.390
Rito?

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.520
What are you making so much noise about?

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:13.360
Mikan!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.370
T-There's a naked girl on the roo-

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.330
Wh-?!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.010
Wha-

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:38.430
Mikan, Rito, what are you doing?

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:39.900
Eh? Mau-

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:41.710
Celine! It's not what it looks like!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.910
This is because Rito suddenly-

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:44.810
Eh?

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.220
Or rather, did you just speak-

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.820
Huh!?

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.140
Hey, Mikan.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:56.880
It looks like my body grew a little bit again. {lol, a little bit}

00:16:56.880 --> 00:17:02.010
I'd like to borrow your or Momo's clothes if I can... is that okay? {nope, you have to walk around naked}

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:06.830
I-It couldn't be...

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:11.610
Eh!?

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:14.340
So, this girl is Celine-chan?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:17.040
That's right.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.670
B-But why so suddenly?

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.350
I don't really know why either.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.360
I was really sleepy today,

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:31.360
so I took an early bath with Lala and went to sleep in Mikan's room.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.560
I slept like that for a while, but...

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.110
The next thing I knew...

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.480
What does this mean?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:55.550
Momo-san, you know a lot about plants, right?

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.840
Well, I try to anyway.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:04.830
There aren't many plant-like aliens like Celine-san, even out in space.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:08.850
It seems there may be much about
her ecology that we don't know yet.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:13.730
I was surprised when she suddenly
turned into the form of a child, too!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.990
It was sudden again this time, wasn't it?

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:22.770
Well, now I've grown bigger,

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:27.910
but please take care of me Rito, Mikan, everyone.

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.370
Okay!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.360
Yeah.

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.670
Yep.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:43.950
Mikan?

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.330
Is something wrong?

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:53.600
I was putting away Celine's clothes and somehow I felt kind of sad.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:57.900
I was thinking that she won't wear these tiny clothes any more.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:03.870
It isn't like she's gone or anything, but it's a strange feeling.

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:05.520
It really is.

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.870
It happened so abruptly, after all.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:10.930
Now she's become able to speak.

